        "original_id": "991c64bf-ebda-5f4f-829f-87dfe52fc561",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Buick T-Type, Buick GS\n- Companies: Buick\n- Topics: automotive marketing, high-performance cars\n\nFacts:\n- Since 1965, Buick has used the Buick GS designation on several high-performance cars.\n- In the 1980s, the Buick T-Type was a series of Buick automobiles that was popular.\n- In the 1980s, Buick used the T-Type as a marketing approach for Buick products.\n- Buick's 1980s T-Type marketing approach revived a similar approach Buick had used in the 1960s.\n- Buick later revived the Buick GS designation again in the 1990s.",
